      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Brett Kavanaugh is mapped onto the man in the image",
      "description": "The text 'brett kavanaugh 17' is positioned above the man's head, directly mapping the textual entity 'brett kavanaugh' onto the visual entity 'man'. This creates an analogical mapping where the man visually represents Brett Kavanaugh in the context of the meme's satirical Jeopardy! game show scene.",
